SUMMARY:✨ Gong Sound Immersion in the Dome ✨with David Heiss✨
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\n**Star Sounds with David Heiss**\n**Spe
 cializing in Astrological Events and Sound Healing Journeys**\n\nStep into
  the energy of Mars and Venus with Sound and deep restoration\, reflection
 \, and vibrational alignment at the beautiful Light Center in Black Mounta
 in\, NC.\n\n### Gong Sound Journey with David Heiss\n\nAs we move through 
 the heart of Leo Season w **Lions Gate** approaching\, Mars in Gemini form
 s a dynamic square to Venus in Virgo\, creating a tension between the mind
  and the heart\, curiosity and commitment\, movement and meaning.\nMars in
  Gemini can scatter our energy in many directions\, while Venus in Virgo s
 eeks clarity\, refinement\, and purpose. Together they invite us to examin
 e where we may be overthinking\, over analyzing\, or divided between what 
 we desire and what truly nourishes us.\nThis immersive gong sound journey 
 offers an opportunity to step beyond mental noise and reconnect with a dee
 per inner rhythm. The rich vibrations of gongs\, singing bowls\, and sacre
 d sound create space for relaxation\, insight\, and nervous system restora
 tion.\nJoin David Heiss for an evening of sound\, stillness\, and renewal 
 as we explore the balance between thought and feeling\, action and wisdom\
 , under the radiant fire of Leo Season.\n**Come as you are. Leave a little
  lighter.**\n\nThis special gathering invites you into a meditative sound 
 journey designed to calm the nervous system\, quiet the noise of the outer
  world\, and awaken clarity within.\n\nThrough the immersive tones of gong
 s\, singing bowls\, and healing frequencies\, we will create space to rele
 ase mental overload\, reconnect with intuition\, and align with the changi
 ng energies of this pivotal time.\nHeld in the peaceful mountain energy of
  the Light Center\, this experience is both grounding and expansive... an 
 invitation to slow down\, breathe deeply\, and listen inward.\nCome as you
  are. **Bring a yoga mat\, blanket\, pillow\, water\, and anything needed 
 to remain comfortable while lying down during the sound immersion.**\n\n**
 The evening will begin with a brief astrology transmission exploring the d
 eeper meaning of Venus and Mars**\, illuminating the dance between desire 
 and discernment\, movement and meaning\, heart and mind. We will then jour
 ney into an immersive gong sound healing **In the Dome** featuring several
  gongs\, crystal and Tibetan bowls\, and other deeply resonant instruments
  designed to calm the mind\, awaken the spirit\, and realign the nervous s
 ystem with the rhythms of nature and cosmos.\n\n**This will be an afternoo
 n of stillness\, wonder\, activation\, and connection beneath the living s
 ky with Sound.**\nCome ready to listen\n\nCome ready to receive\n\nCome re
 ady to remember\n\n### 👤 **About David Heiss**\n\nDavid Heiss is an **E
 volutionary Astrologer and Sound Alchemist** devoted to guiding others int
 o deeper self-awareness through vibration and cosmic insight.\nSince 2012\
 , he has worked with the transformative power of **gongs and astrology**\,
  following a profound awakening that shifted his life toward a path of hea
 ling and inner discovery.\nHis work blends:\n\n* **Astrological intelligen
 ce** (understanding your soul’s path)\n* **Sound immersion** (direct vib
 rational experience)\n\nCreating a space where participants can **remember
  who they are on a deeper level**.\nHis intention is simple and precise: t
 o help you **experience yourself more fully**.\nSign up here:\n**Tickets: 
 $30 in advance\; day of event $35**
